Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:34.99,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fscx47\fad(564,1)\pos(35,280)}Enjoy the Resort to the Fullest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:02.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A resort!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:03.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And a super landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.31,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Stop jumping. You'll trip and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:20.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm glad all these State Security Service \Nofficers are keeping an eye out for the bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:24.28,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But I keep feeling like I'm being \Nstared at, and it's insanely distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:28.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I've heard that at times like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:32.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,normal papas would also jump and play \Nand have fun with their daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's go enjoy this resort to the fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:37.67,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa's such a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:45.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:46.64,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:48.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You got our message?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:53.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I was given the day off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Your face seems a little swollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.61,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:00.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:06.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The couple we were entertaining \Ngot into an argument...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:08.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,and when I got between them to stop them, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:10.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So then the deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, it fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:18.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But we did everything we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:21.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And in the end, the couple was smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:23.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So I'm happy with the results!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:25.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.93,0:03:28.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Can Mama play today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:30.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes! Let's make sure to play lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:32.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Enjoy we shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,They look like Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Everything's so peaceful here. It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:16.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:19.96,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Though being on that ship \Nwas rather ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:34.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I hope peaceful days like \Nthis will continue forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:41.15,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,And to make that happen, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:46.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:51.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna do the thing where you go into \Nthe ocean and look at fishies next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?! You have to wear a \Nswimsuit for this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:58.58,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no... If they see the wound on my chest,\N I won't be able to talk myself out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:03.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Actually, we might get eaten \Nby sharks, so never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:10.22,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I might be able to cover \Nit with this swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't worry. There are no sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:19.73,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Even if there are, \NI'll secretly beat them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:42.84,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Ba bwishies bar bo bretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,{\an3\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HC68DE7&\4c&HC68DE7&\bord2\shad1\pos(594,309)}The fishies are so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:46.63,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Bes. Bey book bo beliblous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:46.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HC68DE7&\4c&HC68DE7&\bord2\shad1\pos(50,309)}Yes. They look so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:53.10,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to go surfing next!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:57.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here comes a great wave, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:57.77,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:59.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll give you a little push.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.39,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:05.27,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I just finished a job, \Nso my sense of strength is still off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:16.54,main,Boys,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:19.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Miss Anya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna do that again! \NI wanna do that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So thrilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:24.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:27.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:33.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We played lots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:35.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:40.60,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's just about time. We should \Nhead back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:41.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.15,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:54.45,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I've been fighting without sleep or rest,\Nso I'm suddenly very sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.08,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Um... Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:03.58,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa... Anya's sleepy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:04.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Tired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:05.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:18.43,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya's one thing, but Yor, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:22.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm guessing this job was \Npretty rough on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:27.44,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And yet, she did her best to go \Nalong with Anya's requests...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,You did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.86,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HECDED6&}Souvenirs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:05.12,main,Handler,0,0,0,,This incident on the Lorelei...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.41,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Though it hasn't been announced publicly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:10.17,main,Handler,0,0,0,,apparently, a lot of \Npassengers went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:13.00,main,Handler,0,0,0,,All of them had forged IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:17.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I did indeed see a number of \Nsuspicious-looking characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:20.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If any are involved in instigating \Nconflict between the East and West,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,we should look into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:25.39,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Apparently the State Security Service thinks \Nthere's another country involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:30.40,main,Handler,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're going to erase any trace \Nof this incident happening, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:36.78,main,Handler,0,0,0,,We'll just keep our eye out for any \Nextremists in Ostania on our end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.78,main,Handler,0,0,0,,This would involve Strix, as well.\N I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:42.20,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:43.83,main,Handler,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:49.04,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Putting aside the bombing incident, \Nhow was your vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:51.04,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Was little Anya happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:55.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I've had enough vacations. They're far \Nmore backbreaking than my usual missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:02.55,main,Handler,0,0,0,,I can never tell if he's \Nactually clever or clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:21.95,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(321,210)\fscx35}Bragging About Vacation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:29.07,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Oh, Yor. You're back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:34.13,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Jeez, Yor. No fair that only you got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.84,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Where's my souvenir from the cruise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.01,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,Again, she was entertaining guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:42.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes. I found a very lovely \Nsouvenir on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:50.77,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,What... is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:53.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's a skeleton keychain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:58.48,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Oof, this is the worst. \NI definitely don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.69,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,What is wrong with your taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:03.70,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Usually, people would get \Ntheir coworkers wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:07.37,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,snacks, or other consumables \Nfor souvenirs, wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:09.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:15.79,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa wouldn't buy me this. \NMama, buy this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:18.30,flashback italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I clearly said I'd buy that for her, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:22.55,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,This is very cool, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:25.64,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll get these as souvenirs \Nfor Camilla and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:28.93,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:34.19,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid picked out some snacks for Yuri's gift.\NShould I just give them those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:36.52,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,There won't be enough for everyone, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.69,0:12:41.19,main,Carmilla,0,0,0,,Well... I can't say I didn't expect this from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:45.03,main,Millie,0,0,0,,What? Wine totally would've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:50.54,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,I guess I'll give it to my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.29,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Skip, skip, la, la, la!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:13:02.51,top,Yuri,0,0,0,,La, la, la! La, la, la! La, la, la...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.63,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You seem to be a good mood, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.55,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Did something happen with your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:07.85,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you knew \Nthis was about my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:09.39,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Are you some kind of psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.72,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:16.31,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,My sister's back from her business trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:20.32,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop by my \Nsister's place after work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:24.53,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,It's been so long since \NI've seen Sis! Sis! Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:27.32,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,But if she's back, that also means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:28.70,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\i0}He's{\i1} back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:39.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:44.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's quite a pain to prepare all this \Nevery time her brother comes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.05,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But despite him being a relative,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:49.43,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,he's an officer of the State Security Service,\N the arch-nemesis of WISE.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:53.02,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Letting my guard down even \Na little may cost me dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:57.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It'll probably look more convincing if \NI move the pillows closer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:01.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I should also add more recent family photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Maybe I should prepare matching \Npajamas, too, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.92,main,Girl student A,0,0,0,,Hey, did you go anywhere during the break?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:23.00,main,Girl student B,0,0,0,,I went to see Pecasso's works \Nat the art museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:26.34,main,Boy student A,0,0,0,,I went to the National Opera \NHouse and saw an orchestra.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:27.80,main,Girl student A,0,0,0,,How cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:41.22,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Good day, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:43.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh. Morning, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:47.28,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh? You look a little tanned. \NDid you go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:51.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh. Are you sure you want \Nto ask me that, little lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:15:00.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's a long story, but yes, that day,\N Anya was on the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:04.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It was the start of an epic adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.30,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Who is she trying to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:09.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has now been aboard...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,a luxury cruise ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.68,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Wait, what did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:13.68,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:16.22,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Anya, you're such a celebrity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:20.69,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?! You really \Ngot to ride that legendary ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:24.44,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey, you. You need to think better of Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:26.65,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I was wrong, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:29.24,main,Damian,0,0,0,,The Holgers definitely deserve \Nto come over to my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.57,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Come over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:37.16,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is a skilled agent who \Ndoesn't forget the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.62,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Aw, that's pretty normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.67,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's not normal at all! It was super huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:46.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It was called Prindess Lalalai, or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:50.79,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You mean the {\i1}Princess Lorelei{\i0}? I rode \Non it there before I enrolled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.72,main,Becky,0,0,0,,It was okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:53.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:59.18,main,Becky,0,0,0,,We stayed in the imperial suite, but the \Nfurnishings didn't quite do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:00.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:03.10,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya stayed in a jail cell in third class...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.77,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Pfft!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:09.82,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,If I stayed in third class, I'd be \Ntoo embarrassed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.91,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it. I feel bad for the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:19.08,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Just the other day, I got to \Nfly over Münk in a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:21.29,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,It was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:26.09,main,Emile,0,0,0,,We stayed at a luxury hotel in Bayan, \Nand I ate tons of yummy things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:28.17,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hmph. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:33.34,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I got my papa to let me have a party with \Nthe actress from {\i1}Berlint in Love{\i0}, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:36.43,main,Becky,0,0,0,,There were about a hundred people there, \Nand I got to hear behind-the-scenes stories
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:37.71,main,Becky,0,0,0,,and received presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:40.60,main,Becky,0,0,0,,It was just {\i1}so{\i0} much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.98,main,Student 3,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:48.07,main,Student 6,0,0,0,,The Blackbells sure are amazing! \NYou're on another level!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:50.48,main,Student 17,0,0,0,,Hey, tell us more about Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.82,main,Student 11,0,0,0,,Was she pretty in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.99,main,Student 16,0,0,0,,Introduce me to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:59.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, on Anya's ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:02.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,There were, like, a hundred \Nreally insane people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.50,main,Student 17,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.58,main,Student 16,0,0,0,,Were there, like, celebrities onboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:08.25,main,Student 12,0,0,0,,Ooh. Like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:13.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Apparently, some came from \Nanother country, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.01,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.43,main,Student 6,0,0,0,,Wait, so foreign celebrities?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:16.51,main,Student 11,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:19.01,main,Student 17,0,0,0,,Well, don't keep us waiting! Tell us who!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:21.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:23.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Like Sickle-and-Chain Barnaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:28.52,italics,All,0,0,0,,Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.15,main,Student 7,0,0,0,,Who the heck's that? Never heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.11,main,Student 4,0,0,0,,A street performer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.07,main,Student 15,0,0,0,,Well, who else was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:34.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:36.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:39.45,top,Anya,0,0,0,,There was Thwomp-man, \Nwho commanded elephants...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:39.87,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(319,1)\pos(320,256)}Lies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:43.04,top,Anya,0,0,0,,And Shwoop-man, who could teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.62,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(319,1)\pos(320,256)}Lies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:46.83,main,Student 7,0,0,0,,Who even are these people? A circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:48.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um... Bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.34,main,Student 7,0,0,0,,Bad guys? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.01,main,Student 4,0,0,0,,What? Did you run into some pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.67,main,Student 4,0,0,0,,That must've sucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:58.76,main,Student 5,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything like that on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:00.22,main,Student 7,0,0,0,,Don't take her seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:02.43,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:05.64,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The incident with the bad guys \Nwill never see the light of day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.94,main,Student 4,0,0,0,,I can't believe I got my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Tsk, tsk, tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:11.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,They weren't on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:15.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's because they're a \Nbunch of secret bad guys that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:17.82,main,Anya,0,0,0,,even the government doesn't know about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:21.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The truth is they came from the \Nbottom of the ocean... They were...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:23.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The octopeople!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:29.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The great hero Anya secretly defeated \Nthem one by one with the stabby thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.33,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Actually, Mama did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:33.21,main,Student 14,0,0,0,,So, what did you and Rachel talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.63,main,Student 17,0,0,0,,Introduce me to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:35.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:40.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And so... the peace of the \Nworld... was protec...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.93,top,Student 14,0,0,0,,No way! Samantha was there, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:44.56,main,Student,0,0,0,,No fair! I want to meet them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:45.98,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Wow, she sure is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:49.85,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,She's such a grandiose liar. \NI guess in one way, she's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.23,main,Damian,0,0,0,,At least you never get bored watching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:55.15,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What the heck is an octoperson \Nwho commands elephants?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:56.53,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.36,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. Get to your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:03.41,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Did you all enjoy your break?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:08.54,main,Student 7,0,0,0,,Sir, apparently Forger \Ndefeated some octopeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:12.08,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:26.43,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:28.77,main,Becky,0,0,0,,We humans are creatures that \Ntry to embellish things
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.02,main,Becky,0,0,0,,at times so we look even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:35.73,main,Becky,0,0,0,,But if you just work hard to \Nget closer to your ideal self,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.82,main,Becky,0,0,0,,you'll become a lovely lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:39.19,main,Becky,0,0,0,,That's what my mama told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:45.03,main,George,0,0,0,,But you should be careful about lying \Nor you'll end up a loner like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:58.30,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Ah! It's been so long, Sis!\N It's been too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:03.51,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\3c&HDCD8C8&\fs20\pos(420,20)}Souvenirs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here you go. I bought you some snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:03.51,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Wow! I'll treasure them forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:05.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Make sure you eat them \Nbefore they expire, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.93,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Then I'll take a picture of them \Nand admire it every single day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:10.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:13.52,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:15.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:20.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh? What's the matter, Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.86,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borboborf?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:28.08,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You tried to act like a celebrity \Nand got made fun of?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.62,main,Anya,0,0,0,,They called me a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:33.21,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya cried a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why would you lie like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:37.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,For Plan B!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,How do you know about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.68,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Because I wanted to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:51.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you let your emotions take \Nover and tell careless lies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:52.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,you'll get burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:54.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you're going to create \Na persona for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:55.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,you need to be strategic and commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Stake your life on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:21:00.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,First, you need to gather enough \Ndetails to make your lie convincing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and work in some truth here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.20,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But be extravagantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. Right... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:09.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But lying isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:11.95,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I've seen so many of them \Nthroughout my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:14.46,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Those who lie are nothing but trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:17.00,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,They're all just filth, nothing more\N than vermin infesting our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:21.28,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Me? The only reason I'm lying \Nabout who I am is for my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:23.86,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Everything I do for my sister is righteous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:27.41,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Only trash tells lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:30.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:34.03,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Of course, you want to be true \Nto yourself whenever you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:37.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able to get \Nalong with everyone! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.39,0:21:55.41,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Lying is too much work, \Nso I'll try not to do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.93,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(435,230)\fscx55}Berlint in Love\N Nightfall's Daily Life
